%% HAND-CURATED. Sliding-window Lua + violation event emission (sys-17 §3.2, §7) — request rejected with 429 emits rate_limit_violation to SQS for sys-13 fanout.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant Redis
    participant SQS
    participant SecurityService

    ParentApp->>Gateway: HTTP request (post-auth, pre-handler)
    Gateway->>Redis: EVAL sliding-window Lua {category, identifier, windowMs, max, burst}
    Note over Redis: 1. check circuit breaker rl_blocked:{cat}:{id}<br/>2. ZREMRANGEBYSCORE outside window<br/>3. ZCARD count vs max<br/>4. branch — under / burst / over
    alt circuit_breaker_tripped
        Redis-->>Gateway: BLOCKED — fast-path reject (no ZADD)
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS and Retry-After
    else over limit
        Redis-->>Gateway: REJECT — increment rl_violations:{cat}:{id}, trip breaker if threshold
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS and Retry-After
        Note over Gateway: emission sampled — first 10 violations per identifier per hour, then 10% sampling
        Gateway-)SQS: SendMessage tbot-security-events {eventType: "rate_limit_violation", requestId, category, identifier, currentCount, maxAllowed, windowMs, violationCount, circuitBreakerTripped}
        alt sqs_emit_failed
            SQS-->>Gateway: 5xx / timeout
            Note over Gateway: log to CloudWatch — do NOT retry, do NOT block response (already sent)
        else emitted
            SQS-->>Gateway: 200 MessageId
            SQS-->>SecurityService: dequeue (sys-13 consumer)
        end
    else burst zone
        Redis-->>Gateway: ALLOW and WARNING — ZADD and emit burst warning
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 2xx and warning header
    else under limit
        Redis-->>Gateway: ALLOW — ZADD entry
        Gateway-->>ParentApp: 2xx (continue chain)
    end

    Note over Gateway,SQS: emission is fire-and-forget — SQS failure never blocks the 429 response — sys-13 consumes for IP-blocklist promotion and ops alarms
